data: {"id": "87bbb88202ce4504-thinking-parallel_evidence-1430", "run_id": "87bbb88202ce4504", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已拿到所有 Kubernetes 层面的诊断数据。让我总结已采集的事实：\n\n---\n\n## 已采集事实与证据结论\n\n### 1. Pod 当前状态\n\n- **生命周期**：Pod 处于 `Pending` 阶段，`containersReady=False`，`ContainersNotReady`。\n- **容器状态**：`app` 容器 `reason=CreateContainerConfigError`，`restarts=0`，**容器从未启动**。\n- **节点调度**：Pod 被调度到 `node2`，IP `172.16.104.12`，CNI 已分配。\n\n### 2. 根因事件（决定性证据）\n\nkubectl describe 和 kubectl events 均记录**完全相同的错误**：\n```\nWarning Failed 59m (x12 over 61m) kubelet\nError: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input\n```\n该事件已重复 ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788425915638, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

