data: {"id": "87bbb88202ce4504-final", "run_id": "87bbb88202ce4504", "seq": 2039, "ts_ms": 1788425950099, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2 的容器配置（YAML）引用了 Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input 中的 key 'unavailable-key'，但实际 Secret 对象中仅包含 key 'available-key'，导致 kubelet 在创建容器时因找不到指定 key 而触发 CreateContainerConfigError。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: CreateContainerConfigError | 核心诊断证据，锁定容器启动前的配置检查失败阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_message`: \"couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input\" | 精确指向故障实体：Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中缺失名为 `unavailable-key` 的 key |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning Failed`: \"Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input\" | 事件日志重复佐证（x12 over 61m），确认为持续且未自愈的异常 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `resource_limit.cpu`: 50m, `resource_limit.memory`: 32Mi | 排除资源限制导致 Pod 启动失败的可能（配置仅为背景参考） |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`=1 (`reason=CreateContainerConfigError`) | Metric 状态与 K8s 状态一致，独立确认容器持续处于等待配置错误状态 |\n\n**证据印证：**\nKubernetes 状态 (`#1`, `#2`) 与事件 (`#3`) 均明确指向 Secret 挂载配置中的 key 缺失问题，且 Metric (`#5`) 独立验证了该状态持续存在。容器重启次数为 0 (`fact-256809ec1d0f`) 且未产生日志 (`Logging.status=not_applicable`)，进一步佐证故障发生在容器启动之前的 kubelet 配置校验阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod YAML 引用不存在的 Secret key ('unavailable-key') → kubelet 验证 Secret 挂载配置失败 → 容器启动流程中止 (CreateContainerConfigError) → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` 的容器配置错误地引用了 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在的 key `unavailable-key`（实际 Secret 中仅包含 `available-key`）。这一配置错误导致 kubelet 在尝试挂载卷时找不到指定 key，从而抛出 `CreateContainerConfigError` 并中止容器创建过程。\n\n**证据支持：**\n- Kubernetes 状态明确指出 `container.waiting_reason` 为 `CreateContainerConfigError` 且 `waiting_message` 显示找不到 `unavailable-key` (`#1`, `#2`)。\n- Metric `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 同样报告了 `CreateContainerConfigError` (`#5`)。\n- 异常组诊断状态为 `diagnosed`，且正式 RCA 已通过配置验证（`diagnosis_publishable: true`）。\n\n**缺失的决定性事实：**\n无。当前 Kubernetes 状态、事件和 Metric 已构成完整证据链，足以确认配置引用错误为根本原因。Logging 和 Tracing 的缺失是因容器未启动导致，不影响根因判定。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 60.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 60.7s (Evidence 52.3s, RCA 8.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- 未调用 Runbook\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 85.961, "metrics": {"run_id": "87bbb88202ce4504", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 85.98340153694153, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "38%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": false, "runbook_id": null, "pass": false, "score": 0.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.045, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "未匹配"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 85983.40153694153, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 80306.13040924072, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 17, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 17, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 19296.21434211731, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5119.666576385498}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 14410.557508468628, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 60707.077741622925, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10825.5136013031, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

